Section
Information
1. Patient Information
Name, age, gender, patient ID, phone, emergency contact
2. Medical History
Previous diseases, chronic conditions, surgeries, family history
3. Medications
Current medications, doses, frequency, medication history
4. Allergies
Drug allergies, food allergies, reaction severity
5. Laboratory Tests
Blood tests, urine tests, hormones, test results, PDF reports
6. Radiology
X-ray, CT scan, MRI, ultrasound, images and radiology reports
7. E-Prescription
Prescribed medicines, dosage, duration, prescribing doctor
8. Doctor Visits
Visit date, symptoms, diagnosis, clinical notes, treatment plan
9. Vital Signs
Blood pressure, pulse, temperature, weight, height, oxygen saturation
10. Medical Documents
Discharge summaries, referrals, medical certificates, uploaded files




